w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">How do motorized retractable screens work?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Motorized retractable screens deploy smoothly from compact overhead housings using remote control or smartphone app. As a certified MaestroShield dealer, Mr. &amp; Mrs. Outdoor Living engineers each system to fit your exact opening dimensions, ensuring a precise fit for lanais, patios, and outdoor rooms.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bcf\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Do retractable screens block outdoor views?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">No. MaestroShield retractable screens fully retract into compact housings when not in use, preserving unobstructed views of your yard, pool, or waterfront. When deployed, they reduce solar heat gain, block insects, and create a private, comfortable outdoor room without permanent enclosure.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bd7\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Are retractable screens weather-resistant in Florida?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Yes. Retractable screen systems use powder-coated aluminum tracks and UV-stabilized mesh fabrics engineered to withstand Florida's intense sun, humidity, coastal salt air, and seasonal wind. Corrosion-resistant components maintain smooth operation year-round with minimal maintenance beyond occasional rinsing and lubrication of the track system.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bdf\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Can retractable screens integrate with smart home systems?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Yes. Motorized retractable screens can be connected to smart home platforms for automated operation based on schedules, sunlight levels, or wind speed sensors. This lets Florida homeowners control their screens remotely via smartphone, voice command, or preset daily routines for hands-free comfort.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077be7\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Do retractable screens increase home value?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Retractable screens add usable square footage, reduce solar heat gain, and enhance the energy efficiency of your Florida home. As a design feature, motorized screens are increasingly valued by buyers in competitive Florida markets — and as a certified MaestroShield dealer, Mr. &amp; Mrs. Outdoor Living ensures your investment is engineered to last.</p></nav></div></div></div><img sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"/images/site/design2-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/design2-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/design2-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/design2-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/site/design2.webp 1920w\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/site/design2.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"design-bg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"146\"></section></div><section class=\"location\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div data-w-id=\"dfdd7317-58e7-27b3-99a6-2c20a5e8a7be\" class=\"header-location\"><h2>Where We Serve</h2><p>Regional Coverage With National Vision</p></div></div><div class=\"cms-country w-dyn-list\"><div role=\"list\" class=\"cms-list-country w-dyn-items\"><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"item-country w-dyn-item\"><img src=\"/images/where-we-serves/custom-pool-builders-north-florida/service-areas-north-south-florida-pools.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Service areas map showing North Florida coverage for luxury custom pool builders and outdoor living services.\" class=\"full-image-background\" width=\"1250\" height=\"938\"><div data-w-id=\"dfdd7317-58e7-27b3-99a6-2c20a5e8a7c8\" class=\"block-info-country\"><h3 class=\"white\">North Florida</h3><p>Licensed luxury pool builders in North Florida specializing in custom inground pools and outdoor living design-build projects, engineered for structural integrity and long-term durability.</p><a href=\"/where-we-serve/north-fl